{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/swkxug","slide":2,"text":"The slide communicates deployment viability through existing drone inputs, two demonstrated runtime modes and standard output formats.\nFlight-path image: SIH26158_HF_Drone_Full253_AB_Colab.ipynb, telemetry audit output.\nDSM image: SIH26158_HF_Drone_Optimization_1088_Colab.ipynb, optimized candidate DSM output.\nThe archived run_report.json records 28.81 minutes for all 253 frames. The project team reports a 15-minute run after reducing the processed frame count.\nField-impact statements are qualitative benefits of remote capture, faster turnaround and interoperable outputs. They are not measured cost or response-time claims."}